        "merge_commit": "25aa14f3879d8d0abc31745757c314e5414f604a",
        "note": "TRUST研究Harness更新的统计准入：迭代候选从reasoning/routing/memory/workflow操作产生，检验决定替换incumbent，保持跨轮历史；可收准入方法与专项理论。 逐项证据、分歧与纠正保留于 docs/internal/reports/maintenance-2026-11-11/。不声称复算全部论文数字。",
        "owner_login": "adongwanai",
        "promote_to_repo": false,
        "reviewed_at": "2026-11-12T07:29:09.486852+00:00",
        "reviewed_on": "2026-11-12",
        "source_hash": "00fcfa798cdab038107ed28b063b45e564ba4d57800409ab1e8f3d559fcf8e95",
        "summary_override": {
          "summary_en": "TRUST organizes admission of Harness candidates as statistical tests across rounds. Historical feedback guides rule or policy revisions, and paired validation outcomes must accumulate sufficient evidence before replacing the incumbent. An LLM allocates testing budget from information available before validation, while test data are used only for reporting. Its guarantees depend on assumptions about bias from reused validation samples and a tolerated loss margin; they control an expected proportion of unacceptable acceptances, not improvement after every accepted update.",
          "summary_zh": "TRUST 把 Harness 候选的准入组织为跨轮统计检验：依据既往反馈提出规则或策略修改，在成对验证结果积累足够证据时替换当前版本。LLM 根据验证开始前的历史分配检验预算，测试集仅用于报告。其保证依赖验证样本重用的偏差条件及容忍损失设定，控制的是不合格接纳的预期比例，并不保证每次接受都提高表现。"
        },
        "week": "2026-W46"
      },
