        "github_pr": 98,
        "kind": "daily",
        "merge_commit": "25aa14f3879d8d0abc31745757c314e5414f604a",
        "note": "JoMoHa 不仅训练两个模型：Engineer 根据历史反馈生成可执行 Harness，程序与 Solver 均跨轮保存；不同保存程序在固定 Solver 下被交叉评估，部署选择保存程序。符合权重与外部 Harness 双方反馈更新和保留。 逐项证据、分歧与纠正保留于 docs/internal/reports/maintenance-2026-11-11/。不声称复算全部论文数字。",
        "owner_login": "adongwanai",
        "promote_to_repo": false,
        "reviewed_at": "2026-11-12T07:29:09.486852+00:00",
        "reviewed_on": "2026-11-12",
        "source_hash": "289417b6bff8d1d27b347f6fe729821aed76b1a6a14fd70195585cb6f76b358c",
        "summary_override": {
          "summary_en": "JoMoHa trains an Engineer that generates executable harnesses and a task-solving Solver using task outcomes. Historical feedback conditions code proposals, which are validated before execution. Saved programs and model checkpoints are selected on validation and frozen for evaluation; program swaps at fixed Solver weights examine the contribution of the code. Its coevolution evidence includes retained and reused code artifacts beyond model learning, without establishing continual self-modification at deployment or local reruns of every cited baseline.",
          "summary_zh": "JoMoHa 用任务执行回报共同训练生成可执行 Harness 的 Engineer 与执行任务的 Solver。Engineer 根据历史反馈提出代码，经验证后运行；保存的程序与模型检查点经验证集选择，再冻结用于评估，固定 Solver 的新旧程序互换用于区分代码贡献。纳入共演化的依据是模型学习之外确有代码工件生成、保留与复用；不能写成部署期持续自改，也不能把引用的全部基线当作同批重跑。"
        },
        "week": "2026-W46"
      },
